---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import icon from '../../Assets/app-icons/glassdays.png';
import home from '../../Assets/glassdays-screenshots/home-light.png';
import widgets from '../../Assets/glassdays-screenshots/widgets.png';
import create from '../../Assets/glassdays-screenshots/create-dark.png';
import folders from '../../Assets/glassdays-screenshots/folders.png';
import '../styles/portfolio.css';
import '../styles/glassdays-case.css';
const store = 'https://apps.apple.com/de/app/glassdays-countdown/id6785538729';
---
<BaseLayout title="Glassdays — Personal countdowns | David Holtschke" description="Count down to the moments that matter with Glassdays for iPhone and iPad. Personal photos, collections, widgets, and optional reminders." canonical="https://holtsdav.com/apps/glassdays-countdown/" portfolio>
  <div class="folio glass-case">
    <header class="folio-masthead folio-shell"><a class="folio-logo" href="/" aria-label="holtsdav — Home">holts<span>dav</span><b aria-hidden="true">.</b></a><a class="folio-header-contact" href="/#projects"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> All work</a></header>
    <article>
      <header class="glass-case-hero folio-shell">
        <div class="glass-case-heading"><p class="folio-eyebrow">SELECTED WORK / iPHONE & iPAD</p><div class="glass-case-name"><Image src={icon} alt="" width={72} height={72} format="webp" /><span>Glassdays</span></div><h1>Good things.<br /><em>Worth waiting for.</em></h1><p>A long-awaited trip. A birthday. The next little thing to look forward to. Glassdays turns your important moments into personal, visual countdowns.</p><div class="glass-case-actions"><a class="folio-button" href={store} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Get Glassdays <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="folio-text-link" href="mailto:contact@holtsdav.com?subject=Glassdays%20support">App support <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><p class="glass-case-availability">Free to download · Optional one-time Pro unlock</p></div>
        <div class="glass-case-preview"><span class="glass-case-preview-note">YOUR MOMENTS, AT A GLANCE</span><div class="glass-case-phones"><Image src={home} alt="Glassdays’ light appearance showing countdowns with photos and pinned events" width={480} height={1044} format="webp" quality={85} loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" /><Image src={widgets} alt="Small and medium Glassdays widgets on an iPhone home screen" width={390} height={848} format="webp" quality={85} loading="eager" /></div><span class="glass-case-preview-footer">Real app screens <span>iPhone</span></span></div>
      </header>
      <div class="glass-case-facts folio-shell"><div><span>PLATFORM</span><p>iPhone & iPad</p></div><div><span>BUILT WITH</span><p>Swift</p></div><div><span>FOCUS</span><p>Personal countdowns</p></div><div><span>EXPLORE</span><a href="/privacy/glassdays/">App privacy <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
      <section class="glass-case-overview folio-shell" aria-labelledby="glass-overview"><p class="folio-eyebrow">01 / THE IDEA</p><div><h2 id="glass-overview">A date is useful.<br /><em>A moment is personal.</em></h2><p>Some dates deserve more than a row in a calendar. Glassdays gives them a place of their own, with a photo, an emoji, and a countdown you can keep close.</p><p>It is designed for small, everyday glances: a collection of upcoming plans in the app, or a widget on your Home Screen.</p></div></section>
      <section class="glass-case-features folio-shell" aria-labelledby="glass-features"><div class="folio-section-heading"><div><p class="folio-eyebrow">02 / IN THE APP</p><h2 id="glass-features">Make it <em>your own.</em></h2></div><p>A few of the details inside Glassdays.</p></div><div class="glass-feature-grid"><article class="glass-feature"><div class="glass-feature-image glass-feature-create"><Image src={create} alt="The New Countdown screen with an emoji, photo preview, and date picker" width={440} height={957} format="webp" quality={85} loading="lazy" /></div><p class="folio-eyebrow">01 / PERSONALIZE</p><h3>A countdown with character.</h3><p>Choose a photo and emoji for each moment. Pin the ones you want to see first, and make the collection feel like yours.</p></article><article class="glass-feature"><div class="glass-feature-image glass-feature-folders"><Image src={folders} alt="Glassdays folders grouping countdowns into Holidays, Games, and Tech" width={700} height={663} format="webp" quality={85} loading="lazy" /></div><p class="folio-eyebrow">02 / ORGANIZE</p><h3>Give your plans a place.</h3><p>Group countdowns in collections, from holidays to the things you follow. Keep your next moments together without losing the ones that matter most.</p></article></div></section>
      <section class="glass-case-small-details folio-shell" aria-labelledby="glass-details"><div><p class="folio-eyebrow">03 / EVERYDAY DETAILS</p><h2 id="glass-details">There when<br /><em>you need a glance.</em></h2></div><div class="glass-detail-list"><div><span>01</span><div><h3>Widgets for what’s next</h3><p>Keep upcoming dates in view from your Home Screen.</p></div></div><div><span>02</span><div><h3>Repeats and reminders</h3><p>Create annual repeats and turn on optional reminders as a moment gets closer.</p></div></div><div><span>03</span><div><h3>Start without an account</h3><p>Create countdowns on your device. Optional Pro features include iCloud sync, calendar integration, and custom widgets.</p></div></div></div></section>
      <section class="glass-case-closing folio-shell" aria-labelledby="glass-next"><Image src={icon} alt="" width={70} height={70} format="webp" loading="lazy" /><p class="folio-eyebrow">SOMETHING TO LOOK FORWARD TO</p><h2 id="glass-next">What’s your<br /><em>next good thing?</em></h2><a class="folio-button" href={store} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Find Glassdays on the App Store <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="glass-case-closing-links"><a href="/privacy/glassdays/">Privacy policy</a><a href="mailto:contact@holtsdav.com?subject=Glassdays%20support">App support</a><a href="/#projects">More work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
